(13.54)–(13.55)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"599"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"623"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" href=\"?note=04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" title=\"27-df-pseudobool\">27-df-pseudobool</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\wedge y\\coloneqq\\{(i,\\min\\{x_i,y_i\\}):i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\},\\qquad x\\vee y\\coloneqq\\{(i,\\max\\{x_i,y_i\\}):i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\wedge y\\coloneqq\\{(i,\\min\\{x_i,y_i\\}):i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\},\\qquad x\\vee y\\coloneqq\\{(i,\\max\\{x_i,y_i\\}):i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Submodular}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\mid\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)+f(y)\\geq f(x\\wedge y)+f(x\\vee y))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Submodular}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\mid\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)+f(y)\\geq f(x\\wedge y)+f(x\\vee y))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\mid\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)+f(y)\\leq f(x\\wedge y)+f(x\\vee y))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\mid\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)+f(y)\\leq f(x\\wedge y)+f(x\\vee y))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>严格采用原书 Definition 13.12 和 (13.54)–(13.55) 的不等号方向；submodular 当且仅当取负后 supermodular。将原来只在 Remark 解释的坐标 meet/join 现在形式定义在 Assertion。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pseudobool","status":"resolved","id":"04a7d534f0d6e0dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pseudobool]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pseudobool","status":"resolved","id":"04a7d534f0d6e0dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$（see [[27-df-pseudobool]]），$x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"x\\wedge y\\coloneqq\\{(i,\\min\\{x_i,y_i\\}):i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\},\\qquad x\\vee y\\coloneqq\\{(i,\\max\\{x_i,y_i\\}):i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Submodular}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\mid\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)+f(y)\\geq f(x\\wedge y)+f(x\\vee y))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\mid\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)+f(y)\\leq f(x\\wedge y)+f(x\\vee y))\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1604,"backlinks":[{"id":"32e50ab8f941fd9b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$